WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:03,800
Captain Luwin

2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:06,200
You accidentally fell down

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,080
Captain Lu can fall like this if he falls down

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:09,400
You weren't beaten, were you?

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,360
Must have been beaten

6
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,880
In this fight, we'll all fight whether it's eighteen or not.

7
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:14,080
It's so hot. I've been so inhumane all my life.

8
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:18,000
Who do you think is inhumane? Dajian, shut up and go.

9
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:35,730
I will try to bring all the supplies back today. How can I share them with you?

10
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:37,210
Take it for yourself if you like it

11
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:38,330
Whatever you take is yours

12
00:00:38,870 --> 00:00:40,310
How much can I take by myself?

13
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:43,350
Isn't this a victory over you?

14
00:00:43,750 --> 00:00:45,790
Didn't I win against you? Go ahead

15
00:00:46,030 --> 00:00:46,990
Take as much as you want
